{"chunk_id": "d444646d52b7", "text": "After crippling Kripa\u2019s chariot\u2014killing his horses, driver, and smashing the vehicle\u2014Arjuna forces the veteran warrior to leap down and hurl a mace, which Arjuna deflects with arrows. Kripa\u2019s allies rescue him, and soon the great teacher Drona advances to confront his own disciple. Arjuna respectfully asks his charioteer Uttara to drive toward Drona, praising the preceptor\u2019s wisdom, virtue, and mastery of celestial weapons before declaring he will not strike first. Despite this courtesy, Drona immediately unleashes a storm of arrows, and the two legendary archers engage in a dazzling duel. Their skill astonishes the assembled warriors, who marvel that a student now battles his guru. The sky darkens with arrows as each counters the other\u2019s volleys, symbolizing the tragic conflict of duty, loyalty, and war.\nAfter Kripa is rescued, Arjuna challenges his teacher Drona, respectfully saluting him before the two begin a fierce, evenly matched duel of arrows.\nThemes: teacher versus student, dharma of warriors, martial honor, archery mastery, battle spectacle", "vector": [-0.005705681163817644, -0.020997995510697365, -0.020630327984690666, 0.0038639309350401163, 0.002347295405343175, 0.02500150538980961, -0.012902465648949146, 0.0030451861675828695, -0.018029408529400826, -0.02730284258723259, 0.006315059028565884, 0.02155630849301815, 0.0018706872360780835, 0.004279260989278555, 0.021175023168325424, -0.0038639309350401163, 0.04038914293050766, -0.011050501838326454, 0.030693568289279938, -0.02843308448791504, -0.0097091905772686, -0.0020306913647800684, 0.004895447287708521, 0.009144068695604801, -0.014080368913710117, 0.020820969715714455, 0.006100585218518972, -0.02700326032936573, 0.008367878384888172, -0.020643943920731544, -0.009893025271594524, 0.006672515068203211, 0.005041833966970444, -0.010750919580459595, -0.021569926291704178, -0.00918492116034031, 0.003096251282840967, -0.006124415434896946,